ution est composée à ce jour des Membres"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[887.0, 4582.0], [1392.0, 4582.0], [1392.0, 4701.0], [887.0, 4701.0]], "score": 0.999282717704773, "text": "suivants :"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1441.0, 4873.0], [4850.0, 4903.0], [4849.0, 5047.0], [1440.0, 5017.0]], "score": 0.9951688647270203, "text": "Monsieur Bernard BELLEC, en sa qualité de Maire de Niort,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1446.0, 5036.0], [2919.0, 5051.0], [2918.0, 5185.0], [1444.0, 5170.0]], "score": 0.9991565942764282, "text": "Monsieur Claude PAGES,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1446.0, 5194.0], [2847.0, 5209.0], [2846.0, 5339.0], [1444.0, 5323.0]], "score": 0.9781962633132935, "text": "Monsieur Robert LEON,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1446.0, 5347.0], [2866.0, 5363.0], [2865.0, 5492.0], [1444.0, 5477.0]], "score": 0.9990342259407043, "text": "Marie Cécile MORISOT,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1446.0, 5505.0], [3062.0, 5525.0], [3060.0, 5655.0], [1444.0, 5635.0]], "score": 0.9922725558280945, "text": "Monsieur Patrick ARNAUD,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1446.0, 5663.0], [3477.0, 5683.0], [3476.0, 5813.0], [1445.0, 5793.0]], "score": 0.9970404505729675, "text": "Monsieur Jean Claude SARRAULT,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1441.0, 5821.0], [3234.0, 5841.0], [3232.0, 5985.0], [1440.0, 5965.0]], "score": 0.9890880584716797, "text": "Monsieur Philippe BRICAULT,"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1284.0, 6262.0], [6171.0, 6301.0], [6170.0, 6444.0], [1282.0, 6405.0]], "score": 0.9943225383758545, "text": "La Nouvelle composition du Conseil d'Administration nécessite une modification corrélative"}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[883.0, 6410.0], [3424.0, 6435.0], [3423.0, 6564.0], [882.0, 6539.0]], "score": 0.9697665572166443, "text": "des Membres de cette Cominission d'Attribution."}, {"orientation_angle": 0, "polygon": [[1283.0, 6722.0], [5322.0, 6746.0], [5321.0, 6880.0], [